{"id":"n40699-2-9","stage":4,"title":"녹슬다 · 生锈","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40699-2-9-1","ko":"요즘 시험 준비를 한다면서요?","zh":"听说你最近在准备考试吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"시험","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}},{"text":"준비를","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비를","audio":"/audio/414d053ad46f03aaeac7.mp3"}},{"text":"한다면서요?","meaning":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","explanation":"하다：承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词；ㄴ다면서：引用所听到的内容，连接后文的评论、确认或对照；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"23","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한다면서요","audio":"/audio/8e0fccb13ce0876e4a06.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"9ce364fc9c6f2a1c","term":"준비","zh":"准备","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3","entryId":"86434","definition":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"承接他人的话或想法等的句子，并修饰后面的单词。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1166f653bc42ead5d7f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40699-2-9-2","ko":"네. 그런데 머리가 녹슬었는지 잘 안 돌아가요.","zh":"是的。可是我的脑子好像生锈了，怎么也想不起来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，可","explanation":"그런데：可是，可。","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}},{"text":"머리가","meaning":"头脑，脑子","explanation":"머리：头脑，脑子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"2","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리가","audio":"/audio/9318933bae4caa2e24ff.mp3"}},{"text":"녹슬었는지","meaning":"生锈","explanation":"녹슬다：生锈；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"녹슬다","audio":"/audio/8c64d016bdf0e6998b1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40699","senseId":"2","lemma":"녹슬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"녹슬었는지","audio":"/audio/e24ed69620a362d577fd.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。",